== Other Farms ==
=== Dragon Moss Farming ===
<pvxbig>
* Requires the [[gww:A_New_Escort|A New Escort]] quest.
* Run into [[gww:Drazach_Thicket|Drazach Thicket]] from [[gww:Saint_Anjeka%27s_Shrine|Saint Anjeka's Shrine]].
* Maintain all enchantments and {{Skill icon|Mantra of Lightning}}.
* Agro all of the Dragon Moss and run back towards the shrine along the ledge.  They should ball up on the ledge behind you.
* Recast enchantments for a fresh set then cast {{Skill icon|Arcane Echo}} -> {{Skill icon|Wastrel's Demise}} -> and then keep spamming Wastrel's pressing <code>TAB</code> each time to switch to a different target.
** If you brought other damage spells, you can cast those as well.
</pvxbig>
